        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Darwin Airline, Darwin Airline Group, Baboo\n- Places: Lugano Airport, Bioggio, Lugano, Switzerland\n- Topics: Airport traffic, Headquarters, Airline acquisition, Branding\n\nFacts:\n- Lugano Airport handles around 200,000 passengers per year across about 2,400 flights.\n- In November 2010, Darwin Airline Group from Lugano acquired Baboo and saved the company from bankruptcy.\n- Darwin Airline SA is a Swiss regional airline with its head office in Bioggio, Lugano.\n- Darwin Airline flies under the brand name Adria Airways Switzerland.\n- The headquarters of Darwin Airline are located at Lugano Airport.",
